; Stationery · Sentence Clock — the words' own alphas in the Light look. Original work, MIT licensed.
; The ink itself is the suite's (InkRGB, from the look). These alphas are the piece's own: a lit word must stand far
; above the unlit grid, which is only texture. Theme-Dark.inc has the same names.

[Variables]
; lit words (88 %)
OnA=224
; unlit words (18 %), with "Unlit Words: Visible" (27 %), and while the pointer is over the words (36 %)
OffSubtle=46
OffVisible=70
OffHover=92
; the lit words' glow (Dark look only)
WordGlow=None
; the hairline over the footer
RuleA=41
